{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.madoka.first",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "站前的喫茶店，有人一直看着你",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.madoka.first",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.madoka.first",
    "idolId": "madoka",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（从今天起就要带偶像了……好——！）",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……嗯？",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "——那个，不好意思。",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "请问，是 283 制作公司的人吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "是的，没错……失礼，你是——",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "突然打扰了。我，对偶像有兴趣。",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "可以的话，能听你说说吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（直视着人的、很漂亮的眼睛……）",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "明白了。我带你到事务所——",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "事务所里面……有点。",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……？",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "在这里简单谈谈就够了。附近的喫茶店……怎么样？",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "——那么，283 会按照本人的资质和意愿来安排活动——",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "资质和意愿？真的吗？不会强迫做不想做的工作之类的？",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我们会提议去挑战，但绝对不会强迫。",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "那就放心了。要是把事务所的门锁上，就逃不掉了。",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（……总觉得像在被审问。）",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "谢谢。已经够了。最后能给我一张你的名片吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊，好……",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "重新自我介绍一下……我是 283 制作公司的制作人——",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……！",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "你就是……",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "如果你想在我们这里当偶像，请务必再联系——",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "啊，想当偶像这件事是假的。",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "我的幼驯染要加入你们那边，我是来确认她有没有被骗的。",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "原、原来是这样……",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "好像有很多不正经的经纪公司。",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……是啊……让你担心了，很抱歉。",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "为了让你认可，我会作为制作人全力以赴。",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "为了让重要的朋友，能飞向她想要的那片天空——",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "很棒的座右铭呢。不过只是嘴上说说，怎么说都行。",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "差不多该告辞了。以后要是有什么事，我会马上联系你。",
        "nextNodeId": "33"
      },
      "33": {
        "id": "33",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "打名片上的电话。",
        "nextNodeId": "34"
      },
      "34": {
        "id": "34",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "啊……等等。既然你不是想当偶像……",
        "nextNodeId": "35"
      },
      "35": {
        "id": "35",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "现在，就在这里，让我星探你……！",
        "nextNodeId": "36"
      },
      "36": {
        "id": "36",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……哈……？",
        "nextNodeId": "37"
      },
      "37": {
        "id": "37",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "见面的时候我就知道了……你是原石……！",
        "nextNodeId": "38"
      },
      "38": {
        "id": "38",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "哈……？别开玩笑了。别靠近我。",
        "nextNodeId": "39"
      },
      "39": {
        "id": "39",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "请务必，和浅仓一起！怎么样……！",
        "nextNodeId": "40"
      },
      "40": {
        "id": "40",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "…………",
        "nextNodeId": "41"
      },
      "41": {
        "id": "41",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……我明白了。既然是这样的话。",
        "nextNodeId": "42"
      },
      "42": {
        "id": "42",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "谢谢……！那么，名字是……",
        "nextNodeId": "43"
      },
      "43": {
        "id": "43",
        "speakerId": "madoka",
        "text": "……樋口円香。请多指教。"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
